- `zustand@5.0.14` is already in `node_modules` as a transitive dependency of drei. I'll add it to `package.json` as a **direct** dependency.
- Persisting to `localStorage` covers both hot reload and full reloads.
- `quality` is auto-detected the first time only, using `hardwareConcurrency <= 4`, mobile UA or `deviceMemory <= 4`. After that the user can override it.

`src/lib/atmosphereUniforms.ts` holds the singleton (`THREE.Color` / `Vector3` instances created once) plus `writeConfigToUniforms(cfg)`. Nothing is allocated per call: it uses `Color.set()` / `convertSRGBToLinear` on existing objects.

